22
00:00:55,302 --> 00:00:58,371
The confirmation code is read letter by letter.

23
00:00:55,545 --> 00:00:57,785
ForgeDesk: Booking Tuesday at 12 PM for you.

24
00:00:57,785 --> 00:01:00,745
ForgeDesk: Done. You're booked Tuesday at 12 PM.

25
00:00:58,371 --> 00:01:00,718
We chose that wording by rendering variants with the

26
00:01:00,718 --> 00:01:03,426
