ForgeDesk: Your confirmation code is F D, Q Z 2 J.

28
00:01:03,426 --> 00:01:05,232
timestamps.

29
00:01:06,185 --> 00:01:07,305
ForgeDesk: Anything else?

30
00:01:14,075 --> 00:01:16,783
Now the hard problem: interruption and

31
00:01:16,783 --> 00:01:18,227
