32
00:01:18,227 --> 00:01:20,393
Audio must stop promptly.

33
00:01:20,393 --> 00:01:23,282
The application must know which words the caller heard.

34
00:01:23,282 --> 00:01:25,267
And a lookup already in flight must never be

35
00:01:25,267 --> 00:01:27,614
spoken as if it were current.

36
00:01:30,483 --> 00:01:32,830
A three second delay is now injected into every

37
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:34,275
