52
00:01:50,466 --> 00:01:53,535
Playback stopped in about a millisecond;

53
00:01:52,854 --> 00:01:53,974
ForgeDesk: Which works for you?

54
00:01:53,535 --> 00:01:56,062
across the twenty run evidence set the median is

55
00:01:56,062 --> 00:01:57,506
fifteen point seven.

56
00:01:57,506 --> 00:02:00,395
The ledger recorded which words reached the speaker, and

57
00:02:00,395 --> 00:02:02,922
