63
00:02:11,588 --> 00:02:14,476
running, reconciled the result into the new

64
00:02:14,476 --> 00:02:17,004
turn, and spoke it exactly once.

65
00:02:24,042 --> 00:02:26,027
The last case breaks most agents.

66
00:02:26,027 --> 00:02:28,916
The booking commits, then the caller interrupts

67
00:02:28,916 --> 00:02:30,721
