68
00:02:32,528 --> 00:02:34,153
Caller: The first one please.

69
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:36,660
ForgeDesk: Booking Friday at 9 AM for you.

70
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:37,369
ForgeDesk: Done. You're booked Friday at 9 AM.

71
00:02:37,051 --> 00:02:39,037
