ForgeDesk: Moving you to Thursday at 12 PM.

84
00:03:05,831 --> 00:03:08,711
ForgeDesk: Done. You're now on Thursday at 12 PM.

85
00:03:06,631 --> 00:03:07,534
moved.

86
00:03:07,534 --> 00:03:09,520
State matches what the caller heard.

87
00:03:08,711 --> 00:03:13,351
ForgeDesk: Same code, F D, N C F J.

88
00:03:13,351 --> 00:03:14,471
ForgeDesk: Anything else?

89
00:03:20,854 --> 00:03:23,923
Measured, not asserted.

90
